body:
![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

In 'listPr4Attempts', when multiple review tasks share the same 'sourceAttemptId', only the first task's ID is added to 'linkedReviewTaskIds' because the loop immediately continues if the ID is already present in 'byId'. This prevents other linked review tasks from being accumulated. Consider updating the loop to accumulate all linked review task IDs for each unique attempt.

```javascript
  for (const task of tasks) {
    if (!task.sourceAttemptId) continue;
    const existing = byId.get(task.sourceAttemptId);
    if (existing) {
      if (task.reviewTaskId && !existing.linkedReviewTaskIds.includes(task.reviewTaskId)) {
        existing.linkedReviewTaskIds.push(task.reviewTaskId);
      }
    } else {
      byId.set(task.sourceAttemptId, {
        attemptId: task.sourceAttemptId,
        paperId: firstString(params.paperId, DEFAULT_PAPER_ID),
        topicId: task.topicId,
        outcome: firstString(task?.completionEvidence?.outcome),
        linkedReviewTaskIds: task.reviewTaskId ? [task.reviewTaskId] : [],
        runtimePosture: task.runtimePosture ?? null,
      });
    }
  }
```

